        {
          "id": "d09-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Evergreen Retail — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Evergreen Retail — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "This report summarises Evergreen Retail's operating performance for Q3 2025. The business operates in omnichannel home goods, and the quarter was shaped by a disciplined cost programme and a pricing reset. Figures are unaudited and reflect management accounts as of quarter close.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Scheduler platform is owned by the Platform team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Leila Farahani, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The finance team will publish a reconciliation to the statutory accounts after the audit.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 92.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 110.1
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 124.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
