        {
          "id": "d09-s6",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "6. Risks and Mitigations",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "6. Risks and Mitigations",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s6-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Top risks for the coming quarter, with the executive owner accountable for mitigation, are listed below. Items are ordered by residual exposure.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 14.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s6-list",
          "type": "list",
          "listType": "unordered",
          "style": "body",
          "items": [
            {
              "content": "Customer concentration — owner: Amara Okafor. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated low."
            },
            {
              "content": "Key-person dependency — owner: Zoe Papadakis. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated high."
            },
            {
              "content": "Migration slippage — owner: Nadia Haddad. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated low."
            },
            {
              "content": "Regulatory change — owner: Jonas Meyer. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated low."
            }
          ],
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 32.3
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s6-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Detailed departmental commentary is available in the appendix distributed to budget owners.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 93.7
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d09-s7",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "7. Vendor Spend",
