        {
          "id": "d09-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q4 2025 the plan assumes stable churn and a step-up in enterprise pipeline. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $3.4M for Q4 2025, weighted towards laboratory equipment.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 14.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
